TITLE pe at 150C for pH 7 pure water with chrysotile+talc and fixed pe=3.506 (diagnostic)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    pe 3.506
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Chrysotile 0 10
    Talc       0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file peq5.sel
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -pe true
END
